[node name="HowText" type="Label" parent="Center/HowPanel/Box" unique_id=488831311]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(760, 0)
layout_mode = 2
text = "Snowballs roll down the ski course from START to FINISH. Stop them before they get there.

• Place: pick a defender in the shop (right side, or keys 1-6) and click beside the track. A green ghost means the spot is free; red shows why it is not (track, scenery, too close, not enough cash).
• Upgrade: click a defender to select it. Each has three upgrade paths; once one path goes past tier 2, only one other path can reach tier 2. You can also change its target (T) or sell it.
• Hero: Camel Claus (key 7, one per match) levels up after every round. Level 3 unlocks Snowball Frenzy (Q), level 4 Focused Shot (E), level 5 camo detection.
• Start a round with Start round (Space) when you are ready. F cycles speed 1x / 2x / 4x, P pauses.
• Layers: every hit knocks off one layer: Coral > Violet > Mint > Blue > Powder > gone. Each layer pays $1, plus a bonus after every round. Outer layers roll faster.
• Special snowballs carry a letter.  B = Black: explosions can't hurt it.  W = White: immune to cold.  A = Aurora: Snow Sorcerer magic can't hurt it.  B, W and A split into 2 Coral when hit.  C = Camo: only defenders with camo detection can see it (some upgrades, Camel Claus level 5).
• Income: the Ticket Booth drops tickets every round. Click them to collect before they melt.
• Lose lives: a snowball that reaches the finish costs one life per layer it still has (a Black, White or Aurora costs 11).
• Win by surviving all 25 rounds. You lose when your lives reach 0."
autowrap_mode = 3

